{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04964","headline":"长门怨 · 吴少微","name":"长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月出映层城，孤圆上太清。\n君王眷爱歇，枕席凉风生。\n怨咽不能寝，踟蹰步前楹。\n空阶白露色，百草寒虫鸣。\n念昔金房里，犹嫌玉座轻。\n如何娇所误，长夜泣恩情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴少微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}